WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:08.182
Hi everyone! We're starting the vlog now,
we're off to Wuhan to meet the fans.

00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:14.360
No idea what time it is,
all we know is we'll meet up inside soon.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000 line:0
<i>See you in Wuhan!</i>

00:00:17.279 --> 00:00:19.686
- Tell us, P'Lena, what disaster struck?

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:24.080
- Now that I've made it this far,
I'm making merit the moment I get home.

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.359
I mean it, I'm going to make merit.

00:00:27.359 --> 00:00:34.480
My heart's been pounding all morning,
it still is. So how did our day start?

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.558
I didn't forget my passport.

00:00:36.558 --> 00:00:40.416
I got a new passport,
but my visa is in the old one.

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:45.239
And I forgot I had to bring both.
I forgot the new one, everyone.

00:00:45.239 --> 00:00:50.199
I didn't forget my passport,
I just forgot the new one.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:03.680
Get a new piece, not this one, right?

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:09.119
Saved! If it's like this,
we're in the clear.

00:01:09.119 --> 00:01:10.708
- Yep, saved.

00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:20.119
- I snuck chili in, then choked on it in
silence, right up my nose like this.

00:01:20.119 --> 00:01:25.720
I had to keep quiet and bear it,
didn't want anyone to know.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:38.075
- So good, really good!
- Oh, this fried rice is amazing!

00:01:38.075 --> 00:01:42.200
- Yes, the fried rice is really good.

00:01:46.159 --> 00:01:50.076
There are these numbing little seeds,
like the ones in the soup.

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:54.360
You taste the spice first, then the
numbness kicks in. It's delicious.

00:01:54.360 --> 00:02:00.399
Here, let's add the chili oil
and the chilies from that plate.

00:02:00.399 --> 00:02:05.966
- This one's the kids' dish.
- Hurry up!

00:02:05.966 --> 00:02:13.759
- It's for kids and old folks,
but we refuse to grow up.

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:36.500 line:0
<i>Let's eat birthday noodles!</i>

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:26.801
Here's a bowl of longevity noodles.

00:02:26.801 --> 00:02:35.480
May you live to a hundred, safe and
well every year. Be happy, goddesses!

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:41.920
The organizers even prepared
another cake for us!

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:50.061
This is Lena and Miu's
second birthday cake.

00:02:50.061 --> 00:02:55.519
The first one was from P'Ann,
when we were filming a show.

00:02:55.519 --> 00:03:00.605
- Wow, it's so chewy!
It's just like pudding.

00:03:00.605 --> 00:03:04.560
- Look, everyone, we got to try it.

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:11.404
- Why? You want to prove
it's paper, not sugar?

00:03:11.404 --> 00:03:15.440
- It's paper!
- Then prove it, or just try it.

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.879
- This is sugar paper.
- Sugar paper?

00:03:19.879 --> 00:03:24.026
- Sugar?
- Wait, wait, wait!

00:03:24.026 --> 00:03:26.840
- Grow up a little!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:32.519
Sorry, but I already proved
it to you earlier, didn't I?

00:03:32.519 --> 00:03:35.203
No, I proved it,
I tested it over and over.

00:03:35.203 --> 00:03:38.200
I told you, it's paper.
I'm not trying it again.

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.930
You kept saying no,
it's sugar, it's sugar.

00:03:40.930 --> 00:03:43.280
So I bit it, and boom, I fell for it.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:47.510
- Hey everyone! Everyone, stop!
- Really?

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:48.510
- Really.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:04:03.439
- No, it kind of melts.
- Trust me, it's edible.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:10.815
- I told you, you can't eat it!
- Huh, it's already eaten!

00:04:10.815 --> 00:04:12.360
- I told you...

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:29.880
Ate it again and realized it's paper,
not a bit of sugar in it.

00:04:37.479 --> 00:04:40.558
Tasty, huh? Still won't stop?

00:04:40.558 --> 00:04:46.080
Stop eating, kiddo, it's paper!
Real paper! Stop it!

00:04:46.199 --> 00:04:53.136
- Mom's going to spank you! Look,
it's Rumi's big brother. Look at him!

00:04:53.136 --> 00:04:57.240
- Yep, it's Rumi's big brother, all right.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:02.500 line:0
<i>Good morning!</i>

00:05:04.199 --> 00:05:09.080
- Good morning!
- Cheers!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:14.309
- We've got a million bodyguards,
but they're here for someone else, not us.

00:05:14.309 --> 00:05:16.579
- Right, they're not here for us.

00:05:16.579 --> 00:05:20.569
- The real stars are over there,
hair and makeup all done.

00:05:20.569 --> 00:05:22.840
- And who on earth are these two?

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:32.800
- Good morning!
- Good morning!

00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:43.520
- So professional!
- Time for our milk! Milk time!

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:49.280
Actually, Lena and Miu are out of battery,
so we need milk to recharge.

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:57.773
- We owe this milk so much.
- Wow, such a huge debt of gratitude.

00:05:57.773 --> 00:05:59.080
- Exactly!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:06.680
Look, I snagged it!

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:34.880
- Oh my God! It's so good!
- These are golden pearls.

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:40.680
- They're not golden pearls,
you have to stir it into the milk.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:45.060
- It doesn't taste like anything.
- I'm analyzing what it is.

00:06:45.060 --> 00:06:49.440
- Give it here, let me taste it.
- But there's nothing in it.

00:06:52.039 --> 00:06:58.919
- Nothing? What do you mean, nothing?
- Maybe you just haven't sucked it up yet.

00:06:58.919 --> 00:07:02.058
- It's mochi, like sticky rice mochi.

00:07:02.058 --> 00:07:05.960
- Oh, so it hasn't come up yet.
Yeah, not yet.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.927
- Here yet?
- No. Now?

00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:09.000
- It's here!

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:16.445
- Sucked it all the way to the end!
- Only Miu knows what that word means.

00:07:16.445 --> 00:07:18.960
- Can I pierce a new one?

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:22.443
Oh, there's a SpongeBob edition!

00:07:22.443 --> 00:07:30.280
Everyone, this is the original Muek Krub,
the super delicious Muek Krub.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:39.919
Guys, is it really SpongeBob? So cute!

00:07:39.919 --> 00:07:43.913
- Hey, is there a SpongeBob picture inside?
- Probably not.

00:07:43.913 --> 00:07:45.199
- Look, here it is!

00:07:45.199 --> 00:07:50.759
Thank you! I didn't take anything.
I'm not hiding anything.

00:07:50.759 --> 00:07:54.199
Your top's about to tear!

00:08:00.639 --> 00:08:06.240
- Take it out, take it out!
- Nobody gets to eat any more.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:11.720
- Look, I brought blueberries from home.
- Wait, Miu has to have fruit every morning?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:19.159
My very own fruit.
Organic blueberries from Ms. Nina!

00:08:19.159 --> 00:08:25.680
At first I thought, wait, when did I
make you fruit? Oh, you meant your mom.

00:08:32.640 --> 00:08:37.519
Whoa, it's a whole bus?
Wuhan Bus Support! Oh, so cool!

00:08:37.519 --> 00:08:43.254
LenaMiu in Wuhan! Oh my God!
Oh, here's the route.

00:08:43.254 --> 00:08:52.200
It passes the Hubei Provincial Museum,
Tanhualin, Yellow Crane Tower, Wuchang.

00:08:53.200 --> 00:08:56.387
- I really want to see that bus!

00:08:56.387 --> 00:09:02.760
- Look, we have to follow it and
see where it goes. Oh, so cute!

00:09:23.279 --> 00:09:27.959
I'm nothing but bones, you know?

00:09:30.279 --> 00:09:33.632
This is fine. Earlier it was too much,
it jabbed me like... ah!

00:09:33.632 --> 00:09:34.632
- What?

00:09:34.632 --> 00:09:37.560
- My bones are really sharp,
you know? Since I was little.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:43.880
And then I had to get my bones adjusted.
My bones are misaligned too.

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:46.681
I had an accident playing this as a kid.

00:09:46.681 --> 00:09:47.681
- It's right here.

00:09:47.681 --> 00:09:50.240
- Yeah, it's cracked,
I'm going to get it checked.

00:09:50.240 --> 00:09:53.480
- It's supposed to be here.
- Right.

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:57.399
I hit it hard playing this as a kid.
What's it called? A seesaw.

00:09:57.399 --> 00:09:59.774
Oh, the wooden one like this.

00:09:59.774 --> 00:10:06.079
I flew up, then came down hard, and it
hasn't been normal since. But never...

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:22.560
See?

00:10:22.959 --> 00:10:28.480
Everyone saw it do this just now, right?
The camera behind caught the legs too.

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:40.399
Hey, why don't you go eat with everyone?
Why didn't anyone invite you?

00:10:40.399 --> 00:10:49.120
- I'm a bodybuilder.
- He's a bodybuilder, everyone, look, look!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:54.279
- Come on, show us!
- Yeah, show it off!

00:10:54.279 --> 00:11:00.360
Okay, we have to pose like this.

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:05.839
What's that? Oh no, it has to make a V.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:11.560
There, like that!

00:11:12.959 --> 00:11:18.200
This pose has a proper
"reference", okay?

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:23.040
- So pleased!
- Your face is all red.

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:29.880
Any trip with her husband, she's extra
happy and wants to head back early.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:33.318
- Like our last Hua Hin trip,
she was happy the whole time.

00:11:33.318 --> 00:11:34.600
- Right, in Hua Hin...

00:11:34.600 --> 00:11:41.360
We behaved ourselves while she stayed
with her husband, since we told her to go.

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:44.352
We sent her off, kicked her out.

00:11:44.352 --> 00:11:49.120
We literally said "kick out",
like "Go!" like this.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:50.652
- We begged: "Please go!"

00:11:50.652 --> 00:11:53.839
- No, we kept watch like parents,
sitting like this.

00:11:53.839 --> 00:12:00.040
Sitting there staring like, "Hmm,
what are you two doing? Hmm."

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:04.600
Someone asked what happened in Hua Hin.

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:12.200
Some things need to be a secret,
something kept just between us...

00:12:12.200 --> 00:12:14.683
- ...a thing that no one should know.

00:12:14.683 --> 00:12:18.240
- That day the Channel 3 crew
came in and saw it all.

00:12:18.240 --> 00:12:20.492
- What happened, Channel 3 crew?

00:12:20.492 --> 00:12:23.800
- Oh right, not telling.
Imagine it yourselves.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.800
But it was packed,
everyone was out on the beach.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:29.757
- Went there for some sweet time,
just you two?

00:12:29.757 --> 00:12:32.399
- No, everyone was on the beach in groups.

00:12:32.399 --> 00:12:37.040
Lots of people, in little groups.
I just took P'Lena out for some fresh air,

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:41.079
and everyone followed us out.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:51.639
Ice cream! There's blueberry
and strawberry too. Oh, so cool!

00:12:51.639 --> 00:12:59.320
Oh my, so many flavors. Thank you!

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.300 line:0
<i>Who are they...</i>

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:25.300 line:0
<i>Welcome, Lena and Miu</i>

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:42.800 line:0
<i>Mommy! Sis! Darling!</i>

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:47.300 line:0
<i>Love you all</i>

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:55.300 line:0
<i>Sis, you're so pretty</i>

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.800
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:38.880
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:14:53.720 --> 00:14:55.448
Today was so touching.

00:14:55.448 --> 00:15:00.240
Everyone was super sweet and
gave us so much positive energy.

00:15:00.240 --> 00:15:05.560
Yes, it felt like everyone said
things that made us so happy, like...

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.717
- "You made my day",
it really cheered us on.

00:15:08.717 --> 00:15:09.839
- Yeah, exactly.

00:15:09.839 --> 00:15:14.880
- See you tomorrow!
- See you!

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:24.839
Oh, good morning! I fell asleep
as soon as I got back last night.

00:15:24.839 --> 00:15:26.360
Really? No shower?

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.759
Of course I showered! Then I lay
there on my phone like this, and...

00:15:30.759 --> 00:15:34.759
- Really?
- And my phone was almost dead.

00:15:34.759 --> 00:15:38.332
- I kept scrolling,
I'm just like my mom now.

00:15:38.332 --> 00:15:39.920
- And nobody helped?

00:15:39.920 --> 00:15:43.920
Well, she was lying in the other bed.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.209
Yeah, she offered to charge it for me.

00:15:46.209 --> 00:15:48.800
But she said:
"If you keep this up, I'll...

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.920
...just take it away.
It's nothing, I just can't sleep."

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:55.440
Wow, so sly!

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:58.547
- So that's what "I'll charge it for you"
meant. Oh my God!

00:15:58.547 --> 00:16:00.600
- I'm the same, if there's any light...

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:03.480
...I'm done. Any light and
I can't sleep, put it away!

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:06.959
Then you can room together.
Does Miu need it pitch dark too?

00:16:06.959 --> 00:16:09.798
- Pitch dark!
- Huh?

00:16:09.798 --> 00:16:12.920
- Totally pitch black.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.680
I'm hungry.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:58.300 line:0
<i>** The mic was a bit glitchy here, sorry everyone **</i>

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:22.480
Look what I collected. I've been craving
this flavor but couldn't find it.

00:16:22.480 --> 00:16:28.199
Birthday-flavored Oreos, a bit tangy,
they take me back to the snacks...

00:16:28.199 --> 00:16:31.033
- ...I ate as a kid,
not knowing what they were.

00:16:31.033 --> 00:16:33.040
- What?
- But it tastes like this.

00:16:33.040 --> 00:16:37.079
- Hey, let me try!
- Here's an Oreo, try it right now.

00:16:37.079 --> 00:16:40.796
- Try it, it's good,
it just sticks to your teeth a bit.

00:16:40.796 --> 00:16:43.319
- No worries, plenty of time to floss.

00:16:43.319 --> 00:16:51.279
- Really? Oh, it's kind of like...
- Yes, it's tasty like that.

00:16:51.279 --> 00:16:54.871
- You described it right, I love it.

00:16:54.871 --> 00:16:59.360
- Yes, that's exactly it!
I want to buy some.

00:17:04.919 --> 00:17:09.760
Century eggs! I love century eggs!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.169
- You've got chili oil?

00:17:11.169 --> 00:17:14.600
- Yes, but isn't it too early?
No, I won't give you any.

00:17:14.600 --> 00:17:20.292
- Yeah, right.
- Nah, I don't want it.

00:17:20.292 --> 00:17:21.640
- Really?

00:17:21.640 --> 00:17:27.960
- Am I spoiling you too much if I give it?
- No, I eat it with buns, not with congee.

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:28.960
- Okay.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:33.360
- So hesitant.
- I want to show you.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:37.160
- Drop some chili in.
- Look at the century egg, so good.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:40.840
Scoop it out.

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:43.670
- Century egg?
- No.

00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:46.840
- Just a bit?
- No, thank you so, so much.

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:49.760
Thanks for the kind thought,
but maybe not yet.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:51.366
- I can't open my heart yet.

00:17:51.366 --> 00:17:54.120
- Miu, why are you closing
your heart like this?

00:17:54.120 --> 00:18:00.240
Open it, open your heart! Open it up!

00:18:02.559 --> 00:18:06.520
Too early for this.

00:18:14.799 --> 00:18:26.480
So many pimples. Miu Natsha breaking out
like this is serious, not okay at all.

00:18:29.799 --> 00:18:32.360
- Done?
- All done.

00:18:32.360 --> 00:18:40.240
- Here, here.
- Oh, your makeup is so pretty, so gorgeous.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:45.039
Yeah, really pretty.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:03.720
So cold!

00:19:04.679 --> 00:19:08.039
Oh my God!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:20.200
I don't need to pee, okay!

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:22.400
Cold! I hate the cold so much.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:27.440
Oh, I really can't handle the cold.
Like... I've got goosebumps all over.

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:33.520
- Goosebumps!
- Don't touch me, P'Toey, I'm cold!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:45.000
Whoa! Out there?
They're dancing out there!

00:19:45.000 --> 00:19:51.799
The DJ's on, so we have to go all out!

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:16.800 line:0
<i>Love you all</i>

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:25.559
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:20:25.559 --> 00:20:31.039
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:45.120
Bye bye, everyone! Bye bye!

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:53.219
Thank you, everyone!

00:20:53.219 --> 00:20:58.320
We're so happy to meet those of you
who came to see us for the first time,

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.332
- and those who've come many times.

00:21:00.332 --> 00:21:02.919
- Yes, from yesterday to today,
there were...

00:21:02.919 --> 00:21:07.080
...so many people meeting us for the
first time, we're so happy. And...

00:21:07.080 --> 00:21:12.520
...we hope to come back here, or go to
another city. We're excited every time...

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:17.760
- ...we get to go somewhere new.
- Yes, we hope we get to go meet...

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:24.240
...lots more of you in other places.
Hope to see you soon. See you, thank you!

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:28.080
See you next time!

